WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:07.860
Countdown in progress.
12 minutes until lift-off.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.280
Mr. Masaru!

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:38.510
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.640
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:47.320
All I want is to be with those I love

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:53.240
Ready or not
Here I come

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.030
I don't care anymore

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.740
I just don't know anymore

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:03.330
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.500
There are days when I think like that

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.090
But everything is precious to me

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.260
And so I fight on

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.760
Today was a tough day

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.810
I almost gave up hope

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:24.940
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.400
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.780
There are days when I think like that

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.530
But everything is precious to me

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:37.570
And so I must fight

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.880
#28 This little piggy

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.590
This is my room now.

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:02.270
What are you still doing here, Masaru?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.350
Scram. This isn't yours anymore.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:11.020
Yeah, there were a lot of me.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.990
But they were all chased out
by you, who came in after me.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:21.160
Of course. I entered this room
through the download, and now it's mine.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.160
So, Masaru.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.620
Time for you to leave.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.960
Leave.

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:31.290
Get out.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:37.340
Scram. Leave. Get out.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:40.890
Leave, Masaru.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.850
Leave your brain.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.060
I wonder how much water was in that well.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:50.560
Huh? What did you say?

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:56.360
That well in Clogue Village
that Yin used to save the villagers.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.360
The one he tossed the soft stone into.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.910
Why do you ask that now?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:10.370
The soft stone turned all the water
in that well into that elixir of life.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.090
Aqua Vitae. Right?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:17.380
I wonder just how much water was in it.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.510
That horrid well?

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:26.560
I'd say about 10 or 15 tons at least.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:32.060
And how does the Aqua Vitae
make the drinker immortal?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:38.490
Interesting. Your fading existence wants
to play questions and answers with me?

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.280
Fine then.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:43.530
This is the end of you anyway.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:45.950
Here's how it is.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.330
Aqua Vitae dramatically enhances
humans' powers of recovery.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:58.460
It restores all the cells in the body
to their healthiest state in seconds.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.970
A homeostatic function super-enhancer.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.600
That's what Aqua Vitae is.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.930
Okay, question time is over.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:15.480
If you're not going to leave,
my consciousness will just eat you up.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.190
-Wait...
-No!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.790
That was so easy. This room is mine now.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.040
I'm not done talking with you.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.630
Still here?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:40.300
Do you know where the soft stone
that makes Aqua Vitae is?

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:45.050
Of course. In Éléonore's body.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:51.770
So a stone that can change
15 tons of water into an elixir,

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.100
is in Shirogane's slim body.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.810
So what?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.320
Nothing.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:02.360
Just that Shirogane's blood
must be really, really...

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.410
really rich Aqua Vitae.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.830
And I...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.410
I drank it.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:20.250
To restore all the body's cells
to their healthiest state.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.920
That's what it does, right?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.760
You don't mean...

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:30.680
Do you think it's healthy to download
outside information into my brain?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.190
Wouldn't my body treat it as a disease?

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.060
You... You...

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:41.440
You knew that and let me download myself
into you!

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:47.450
I drank the richest Aqua Vitae
in this world!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.490
You bastard!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.040
Get out of my brain!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:07.510
No... This can't be happening...

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.270
Are you Masaru?

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.070
Yes, Faceless. I'm me.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.410
My, the breeze feels nice.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.660
Liar.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.250
Unlike me, who has
advanced sensory mechanisms,

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.250
you can't understand
how nice the breeze feels.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:43.630
You got me. You're right.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.630
I've always hated
how you try to show off like that.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.640
Same goes for you.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.730
Thank you, birdies.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:04.320
Vulgar, just like your master.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.070
Hat shield!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.200
Snapping compact!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.280
Not bad.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:15.240
You'll be a nice playmate for me.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.540
I'd rather play with Masaru.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:21.380
And never with you.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:28.510
Countdown in progress.
11 minutes until lift-off.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:33.220
Mr. Masaru, you must leave!
The rocket is going to take off.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.220
I'll never leave you.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.730
I'm going to save you.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:44.570
I can't dismantle it.
The chains and chair have been welded.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.150
Masaru, you little...!

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.910
How dare you trick me like that.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:56.580
But you're still merely a little brat.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.500
Mr. Masaru...

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:06.210
You can't dismantle those chains
or that chair.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.630
How are you going to free Éléonore, huh?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:14.890
Telemetering in progress.
Communication system OK.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.770
7 minutes until lift-off.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.270
Discarding crew access floor.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.900
6 minutes until lift-off.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.360
Opening the exit.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.260
Prepared for lift-off.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:56.100
Look, it's time for Lord Faceless to leave
for his honeymoon with someone he loves.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.760
I'll teach you something.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.020
Human's honeymoons are for those
mutually in love.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.230
Shirogane doesn't love Lord Faceless.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.770
So what?
She might fall in love afterwards.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:14.110
No, Shirogane's destined lover is Masaru.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:18.160
Enough of that. Blow her away!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.700
You wish!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.170
Little dummy. I knew you'd do that.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.300
4 minutes until lift-off.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:40.430
Let's all blast off together then, Masaru.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:45.640
And I'll kill you slowly
on our way to the space station.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.860
I won't let you take Shirogane...

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.110
Really?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.700
Then I'll kill you right now.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.320
Faceless!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.200
What are you doing?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.830
Let him go. Run, Mr. Masaru.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.750
If you don't,
I'll bite my tongue off and die.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:16.800
You fool. Immortal shiroganes
can't die just from that.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:20.970
Shiroganes can bring an end to their lives
by their own will.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:25.230
So leave! Goodbye, au revoir...

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.730
Shirogane!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.490
I can't have you doing that.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.240
You're my one and only. My one true love.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:42.490
60 seconds until lift-off.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.750
Shirogane...

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.750
I'm sorry, Shirogane.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.840
No matter what you do,
I will never resent it.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:08.730
What the...

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.820
You dismantled Éléonore!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.570
Not so fast!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.250
Give it up.
It's too hard to break like that.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.170
Besides, that teddy bear
is going to explode soon.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:40.260
Oh dear! I must run away.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.810
She can make a drill this huge?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.650
She's going to get away.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.860
Let go!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.450
Igniting the main engine.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:08.750
10, 9, 8, 7, 6...

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:13.540
5, 4, 3, 2, 1.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.990
Let go of me!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.750
Lord Faceless's rocket has taken off.

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:54.920
Is that...?

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.170
I'm sorry, Shirogane.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:06.050
I got you free, but it's just too high...

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.180
What...?

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.350
Did she...?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.480
She stopped drilling.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:29.620
Damn you, Colombine!
You and your bugs.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:33.580
Not this again, when I was so close.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.790
Éléonore...

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:43.590
Éléonore!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.480
The rocket!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.360
We might be too late.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.950
I'm sorry for what I did.
It must've hurt a lot.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.290
About dismantling my body?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.790
It is nothing.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.710
But it is taking me a while to recover.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.010
Could you relocate my joints?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.800
I'll be able to walk by myself then.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.970
In a little bit.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:35.430
You've grown so much stronger, Mr. Masaru.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.560
I'm so greatly surprised.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.110
No, I'm not strong at all.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:46.190
I was supposed to protect you.
But you were the one who protected me.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.990
I'm so ashamed.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.070
No, don't be.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.950
You gave me a chance.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.750
A chance?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.500
A chance to repay you
for protecting me all this time.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.250
So, thank you.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.630
Oh, stop it.

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.630
M-Master?

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.890
Guri-pon!
Sorry for tricking you back there.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.220
You're back to normal.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.350
Oh gosh, I was so worried.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.230
Something's coming.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.410
Arlequino, you're still moving too?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.090
And who's that? A human?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.500
If so, let her go.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.670
Take her.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.720
She's hurt. Treat her.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.180
She's human? But why are you...?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.390
Lady Francine's orders.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.520
Where's Éléonore?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.440
Could you relocate my joints now?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.490
I'll be able to climb down with you then.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.700
I knew you'd say that,
so I didn't fix you.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:18.950
I'm sorry. I don't want you
to be in danger anymore.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.080
-But...
-Besides.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.500
Colombine is still back there.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.880
I'll go and get her, then follow you.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.090
Sorry for doing this so roughly.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.720
But I can feel it.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:38.680
That the people down there
will catch and take care of you.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.690
-Take care.
-Yeah.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:05.830
Well, well. To think you'd stop drilling
through the teddy bear.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.300
And now look at you.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.670
What for?

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:15.340
I'm not going to tell you. Not you.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:19.010
But I know. You saved that human, right?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.680
So stupid.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:24.350
And what's he going to do for you?

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:26.270
For me?

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:30.110
No, no. I wanted to do it for him.

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.320
Your cognitive mechanism
must've malfunctioned.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.780
Maybe.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:40.660
I'm an automaton,
but ever since I met him...

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:45.040
I've begun to understand
how humans think.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.670
Anyway, I win.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:52.010
Because I stayed loyal to Lord Faceless.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:57.050
He'll love me as much as Éléonore now.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:18:00.350
Unlike you, a traitor.

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:06.810
Men and women have only one true love.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.480
Humans love just one person,
and they love that person forever.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:18.070
If Lord Faceless loves just one person,
who do you think that person is?

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:22.370
Éléonore?

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.710
Lord Faceless loves you.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.710
But only as a useful tool.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.040
Shut up!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.510
I'm Lord Faceless's girlfriend!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:56.240
My thinking is beginning to get foggy.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.820
Gosh.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:03.540
Who knew the end would come so suddenly.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.500
And just now...

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.880
Now that I've saved Masaru and stuff.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:14.340
I wanted to get closer to him, you know.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.840
I've existed for 180 years.

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.720
But what for? What was I?

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.180
Nothing.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.810
Nothing at all.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:37.240
You saved us when we fell from the rocket.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.700
Is that why you're like that now?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.290
Just another one of my whims.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:53.130
Go away now, my hair is a mess.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.000
My face is scratched up too.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:00.090
I don't want a human like you
seeing me like this.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:04.350
So go on, leave me now.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.900
I'm so happy.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:28.500
I'm finally being embraced by a boy.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.040
The human touch is so warm.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:40.550
The human hand is so gentle.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.300
I'm happy.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.180
So happy.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.680
Just so happy.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:55.270
You did so much for me.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.650
But I kept doubting you.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.700
Hey, Masaru?

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:08.450
Will you tell me the truth now?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:15.710
You love Éléonore, right?

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.460
That... that's not...

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:44.070
This little piggy went to market

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:48.120
This little piggy stayed home

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:52.200
This little piggy had a snack

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:56.370
This little piggy had a gift

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:01.670
And this little piggy cried "wee wee wee"

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:07.010
All the way home to Mom

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.070
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:29.990
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.660
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.460
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:43.920
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:48.890
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:53.640
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:58.480
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:03.270
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:07.990
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:12.620
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:17.370
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:22.500
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:29.930
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:34.850
The melody that brought you here
